; 533  :     // Look for 16bpp dest special case for Winbench --
; 534  :     // Color palette is 8 entries, all black.  This simplifies to a
; 535  :     // black solidfill.
; 536  : 
; 537  : //PingZ 3/12/99 lpSrc->bmiColors may not be pointing to the actual color table!!!  The only
; 538  : //to guarantee that is to add bmiHeader.biSize to lpSrc.  This is to fix PRS #4604
